  localizations:
  - language: 0
    lines:
    - Great, that's right!
    - First, I'll show you how to use this old scrap
    - A circle will appear on the floor
    - Use the WASD keys or the arrow keys to move around inside it
    - Your first mission is to get out of the circle. Copy that, cadet?!
    - Now, let's go! Circle around, everyone!
  - language: 1
    lines:
    - "\xD3timo, isso ai"
    - Primeiro vamos aprender os controles dessa banheira
    - "Quando eu parar de falar, um circulo aparecer\xE1 no ch\xE3o"
    - Use WASD ou as setinhas para se movimentar
    - "Sua primeira miss\xE3o \xE9 sair da marca\xE7\xE3o"
    - "Agora vai l\xE1: circulando, circulando, cambada!"
